{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07120","headline":"送度支留後若侍御之歙州便赴信州省觐 · 刘长卿","name":"送度支留後若侍御之歙州便赴信州省觐","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"国用忧钱谷，朝推此任难。\n即山榆荚变，降雨稻花残。\n林响朝登岭，江喧夜过滩。\n遥知骢马色，应待倚门看。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07120.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07120","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}